            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A zinc atom in which the nucleus contains 35 neutrons. It has a half-life of 244 days, decaying by emission of a positron (β&lt;small&gt;&lt;sup&gt;+&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; decay), and is the most abundant and stable of the 25 known radioisotopes of zinc.</obo:IAO_0000115>
